<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
<p>TANKERS.</p>
<p>Bay Ridge - (built 1979) 224,428 dwt sold for $9.7 million for conversion in to a floating production, storage and offloading unit.</p>
<p>Leonis - (built 1994) 85,020 dwt sold for $38 million.</p>
<p>Scorpius - (built 1994) 85,020 dwt sold for $38 million.</p>
<p>Some brokers said that the Leonis and Scorpius  were sold en-bloc for $72 million.</p>
</text>
